    <briefdescription>
<para>Pluggable tracer interface for <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_chain_of_thought_builder" kindref="compound">ChainOfThoughtBuilder</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Both methods are <computeroutput>noexcept</computeroutput> so that a misbehaving implementation can never interrupt the prompt-construction path. Implementations must handle all errors internally (log + swallow).</para>
<para>Grounded in OpenTelemetry span model:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_i_chain_of_thought_tracer_1ae5bf66df9be5df2a1fdbcc5dd4c04a5c" kindref="member">onStepBegin()</ref></computeroutput> ≈ Span.Start</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_i_chain_of_thought_tracer_1aed9dfb55d3afd870aa31b0e56183856d" kindref="member">onStepEnd()</ref></computeroutput> ≈ Span.End + attribute recording </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
